---
import Figure from "../components/Figure.astro";
import OutOfMemory from "../components/OutOfMemory.astro";
import Route from "../components/Route.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Page not found" description="This page is not part of the guide." slug="404">
	<article class="article">
		<header class="page-head">
			<p class="meta">404 · not found</p>
			<h1>Page not found</h1>
			<p class="lede">This page isn't part of the guide. Every chapter is listed below the game.</p>
		</header>
		<p>
			While you're here, you're the server. Let people into the batch so every pass writes more tokens,
			but leave room for the replies still growing, or you'll run out of memory.
		</p>
		<Figure label="out of memory">
			<OutOfMemory />
		</Figure>
		<p>
			Sizes are scaled down, and a real server pauses or recomputes whoever it evicts. It doesn't know
			how long a reply will run either. <a href="/batching">Chapter 8</a> has the real trade at full size.
		</p>
		<Route />
	</article>
</Base>
